&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;希薄化後1株当たり当期利益（円）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 163px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: right"&gt;424.50&lt;/p&gt;
